  "prefLabel": "He-P 4038.05 Interpretations",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-P 4038.05 Interpretations. Except as specifically authorized by DHHS/RHS in writing, no interpretation of the meaning of He-P 4038 by any officer or employee of DHHS/RHS other than a written interpretation by the Attorney General’s Office shall be recognized as binding upon DHHS/RHS.\n\nSource. #11105, eff 5-25-16",
